sequenceDiagram
    title Finance Budget Tracker: sign-in and adding a financial transaction
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant FE as React frontend
    participant BE as Backend API
    participant DB as Database

    rect rgb(240, 247, 243)
    Note over User,DB: Authentication
    User->>FE: Enter email and password, select Log In
    FE->>BE: POST /api/auth/login { email, password }
    BE->>DB: Find user by email
    DB-->>BE: User with password hash
    BE->>BE: Check password with bcrypt, sign a JWT
    BE-->>FE: 200 { token, user }
    FE->>FE: Store token in localStorage
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 240)
    Note over User,DB: Create transaction
    User->>FE: Submit income or expense form
    FE->>BE: POST /api/transactions (Bearer token + form data)
    BE->>BE: Verify token, validate data
    BE->>DB: Save with the token's user id
    DB-->>BE: Saved record
    BE-->>FE: 201 saved transaction
    FE->>BE: GET summary, transactions, categories, and spending report
    BE-->>FE: 200 with this user's data
    FE-->>User: Refresh dashboard and chart
    end

    Note over User,DB: Error paths: 401 for a wrong password or a missing, invalid, or expired token (the frontend returns to login). 400 with reasons for invalid data.
